  "term": "GH",
  "definition": "GH stands for growth hormone, a regulator of the somatotropic hormonal system that controls IGF-1. In the source, the GH–IGF-1 pathway is described as relevant to growth, neurodevelopment, brain function, behavior, and stress-related neuroendocrine activity.",
